  spoon - help

  Keybindings
  -----------

  Transition notice (one release)
  t: enrichment ceiling -> dark/light theme
  c: open compare -> enrichment ceiling
  d: unbound -> open compare


  Global
  ctrl+c          Quit

  Repository input
  Enter           Search repository
  Esc             Return to fork table
  left/ctrl+b     Move input cursor left
  right/ctrl+f    Move input cursor right
  home/ctrl+a     Move input cursor to start
  end/ctrl+e      Move input cursor to end
  backspace       Delete previous character
  delete          Delete next character
  ctrl+u          Clear input

  Fork table
  q               Quit
  Up/k            Move selection up
  PgUp/PgDn scroll . Press ? or Esc to go back